title: 'Not reported, by choice of cost: the hides of a save whose rerender is withheld under a restriction, and what merges, restores and delete propagation add.'
pid: 2f5122f0-69ae-4f47-a902-a2b5444a3f5a
body: |2-
  The first is the one a user could meet: hides written, nothing said.
  Mending it touches 'update_views_after_save' and each client's
  release handler.
